{
  "slug": "ads-agent",
  "name": "Ads Agent",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AdsAgent turns Claude into your always-on Google Ads analyst. Audit account health, set up new campaigns from scratch, analyze Quality Score and Ad Rank, manage keywords and bids, mine search terms for negatives, generate A/B-tested ad copy, configure tracking, and run bulk operations across hundreds of keywords — all through conversation. No dashboards, no spreadsheets, no clicking through the Google Ads UI.\nUnder the hood: 40+ MCP tools with full read/write access to your Google Ads data, plus three built-in skills — /ads for campaign management, /ads-audit for account health scoring, and /ads-copy for ad copywriting.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `ads` (Manage Google Ads campaigns — read performance, optimize keywords, adjust bids and budgets, add negatives, pause/enable campaigns, manage…), `ads-audit` (Google Ads account audit and business context setup), `ads-copy` (Generate and A/B test Google Ads copy)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `adsagent`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ads-agent@claude-community` from `nowork-studio/adsagent-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
